IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `aia-core`
IMPORT `aia-timeline`
IMPORT `P6-art-51-52`
IMPORT `P6-annex-xi-xiii`
IMPORT `P6-art-53-54`

-- P6-tests-art-53-54: tests of Articles 53 and 54, written from the text (work/gen_53_54_tests.py decides each expected value from the text, not from the encoding).
-- Chapter V applies from 2 August 2025; Art 111(3): the provider of a model placed on the market before 2 August 2025 has until 2 August 2027.
-- The argument order of each function is stated above its group of assertions: two BOOLEAN or two DATE arguments swapped would still type-check.

§ `Dates and models used in the tests`

`Art 53 test the day before the group applies` MEANS Date 1 8 2025
`Art 53 test a later day` MEANS Date 1 3 2026
`Art 53 test the day before the legacy time ends` MEANS Date 1 8 2027
`Art 53 test the first day of the legacy time` MEANS Date 2 8 2027

-- A model placed on the market on 3 August 2025, after the group begins to apply.
`Art 53 test model` MEANS `AI model` WITH
    `date placed on the market` IS Date 3 8 2025
    `cumulative compute used for its training, in floating-point operations` IS 10_000_000_000_000_000_000_000_001

-- A model placed on the market on 1 August 2025: Art 111(3) gives its provider until 2 August 2027.
`Art 53 test legacy model` MEANS `AI model` WITH
    `date placed on the market` IS Date 1 8 2025
    `cumulative compute used for its training, in floating-point operations` IS 10_000_000_000_000_000_000_000_001

§ `Article 53(2): the exception for free and open-source models`
-- args: date asked, general-purpose AI model, free and open-source licence, parameters public, architecture public, usage public, systemic risk
#ASSERT `Art 53(2) the exception for free and open-source models applies` `Art 53 test a later day` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- each of the four facts is needed
#ASSERT `Art 53(2) the exception for free and open-source models applies` `Art 53 test a later day` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 53(2) the exception for free and open-source models applies` `Art 53 test a later day` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 53(2) the exception for free and open-source models applies` `Art 53 test a later day` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 53(2) the exception for free and open-source models applies` `Art 53 test a later day` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- "This exception shall not apply to general-purpose AI models with systemic risks"
#ASSERT `Art 53(2) the exception for free and open-source models applies` `Art 53 test a later day` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 53(2) the exception for free and open-source models applies` `Art 53 test the day before the group applies` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 53(2) the exception for free and open-source models applies` `Art 53 test a later day` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
§ `Article 53(1), point (a): the technical documentation`
-- args: date asked, model, general-purpose AI model, the exception of paragraph 2 applies
#ASSERT `Art 53(1)(a) the provider must draw up and keep up-to-date the technical documentation of the model` `Art 53 test a later day` `Art 53 test model` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the open-source exception lifts points (a) and (b)
#ASSERT `Art 53(1)(a) the provider must draw up and keep up-to-date the technical documentation of the model` `Art 53 test a later day` `Art 53 test model` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 53(1)(a) the provider must draw up and keep up-to-date the technical documentation of the model` `Art 53 test the day before the group applies` `Art 53 test model` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 53(1)(a) the provider must draw up and keep up-to-date the technical documentation of the model` `Art 53 test a later day` `Art 53 test model` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Art 111(3): a model placed before 2 August 2025, not before 2 August 2027
#ASSERT `Art 53(1)(a) the provider must draw up and keep up-to-date the technical documentation of the model` `Art 53 test a later day` `Art 53 test legacy model` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 53(1)(a) the provider must draw up and keep up-to-date the technical documentation of the model` `Art 53 test the day before the legacy time ends` `Art 53 test legacy model` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 53(1)(a) the provider must draw up and keep up-to-date the technical documentation of the model` `Art 53 test the first day of the legacy time` `Art 53 test legacy model` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- args: date asked, model, general-purpose AI model, the exception applies, drawn up, kept up-to-date, contains the information set out in Annex XI
#ASSERT `Art 53(1)(a) the technical documentation of the model is what the point requires` `Art 53 test a later day` `Art 53 test model` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 53(1)(a) the technical documentation of the model is what the point requires` `Art 53 test a later day` `Art 53 test model` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 53(1)(a) the technical documentation of the model is what the point requires` `Art 53 test a later day` `Art 53 test model` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 53(1)(a) the technical documentation of the model is what the point requires` `Art 53 test a later day` `Art 53 test model` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- the exception applies: the point does not bind this provider
#ASSERT `Art 53(1)(a) the technical documentation of the model is what the point requires` `Art 53 test a later day` `Art 53 test model` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 53(1)(a) the technical documentation of the model is what the point requires` `Art 53 test the day before the group applies` `Art 53 test model` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 53(1)(a) the technical documentation of the model is what the point requires` `Art 53 test a later day` `Art 53 test legacy model` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- rule: no time limit and no consequence; day 0 is the date asked. args: date asked, model, general-purpose AI model, the exception applies
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 53(1)(a) the provider's duty to draw up and keep up-to-date the technical documentation` `Art 53 test a later day` `Art 53 test model` TRUE FALSE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Provider DOES `Art 53(1)(a) draw up and keep up-to-date the technical documentation of the model` AT 400
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `Art 53(1)(a) the provider's duty to draw up and keep up-to-date the technical documentation` `Art 53 test a later day` `Art 53 test model` TRUE FALSE AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 53(1)(a) the provider's duty to draw up and keep up-to-date the technical documentation` `Art 53 test a later day` `Art 53 test model` TRUE TRUE AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 53(1)(a) the provider's duty to draw up and keep up-to-date the technical documentation` `Art 53 test the day before the group applies` `Art 53 test model` TRUE FALSE AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
