#ASSERT `Art 53(1)(b) the information and documentation are what the point requires` `Art 53 test the day before the group applies` `Art 53 test model` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- rule: no time limit and no consequence. args: date asked, model, general-purpose AI model, the exception applies
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 53(1)(b) the provider's duty to make information and documentation available to providers of AI systems` `Art 53 test a later day` `Art 53 test model` TRUE FALSE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Provider DOES `Art 53(1)(b) draw up, keep up-to-date and make available information and documentation to providers of AI systems who intend to integrate the model into their AI systems` AT 400
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `Art 53(1)(b) the provider's duty to make information and documentation available to providers of AI systems` `Art 53 test a later day` `Art 53 test model` TRUE FALSE AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 53(1)(b) the provider's duty to make information and documentation available to providers of AI systems` `Art 53 test a later day` `Art 53 test model` TRUE TRUE AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
§ `Article 53(1), point (c): the copyright policy`
-- args: date asked, model, general-purpose AI model. The open-source exception of paragraph 2 does not reach point (c).
#ASSERT `Art 53(1)(c) the provider must put in place a policy to comply with Union law on copyright and related rights` `Art 53 test a later day` `Art 53 test model` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 53(1)(c) the provider must put in place a policy to comply with Union law on copyright and related rights` `Art 53 test the day before the group applies` `Art 53 test model` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 53(1)(c) the provider must put in place a policy to comply with Union law on copyright and related rights` `Art 53 test a later day` `Art 53 test model` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 53(1)(c) the provider must put in place a policy to comply with Union law on copyright and related rights` `Art 53 test a later day` `Art 53 test legacy model` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 53(1)(c) the provider must put in place a policy to comply with Union law on copyright and related rights` `Art 53 test the first day of the legacy time` `Art 53 test legacy model` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- args: date asked, model, general-purpose AI model, a policy is in place, identifies a reservation of rights, complies with a reservation of rights
#ASSERT `Art 53(1)(c) the copyright policy is what the point requires` `Art 53 test a later day` `Art 53 test model` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 53(1)(c) the copyright policy is what the point requires` `Art 53 test a later day` `Art 53 test model` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 53(1)(c) the copyright policy is what the point requires` `Art 53 test a later day` `Art 53 test model` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 53(1)(c) the copyright policy is what the point requires` `Art 53 test a later day` `Art 53 test model` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 53(1)(c) the copyright policy is what the point requires` `Art 53 test the day before the group applies` `Art 53 test model` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 53(1)(c) the copyright policy is what the point requires` `Art 53 test a later day` `Art 53 test model` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 53(1)(c) the provider's duty to put in place a copyright policy` `Art 53 test a later day` `Art 53 test model` TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Provider DOES `Art 53(1)(c) put in place a policy to comply with Union law on copyright and related rights` AT 400
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `Art 53(1)(c) the provider's duty to put in place a copyright policy` `Art 53 test a later day` `Art 53 test model` TRUE AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 53(1)(c) the provider's duty to put in place a copyright policy` `Art 53 test the day before the group applies` `Art 53 test model` TRUE AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
