§ `Article 54(1): the duty of a third-country provider to appoint an authorised representative`
-- args: date asked, model, general-purpose AI model, the provider's place, the open-source exception of Article 54(6) applies
#ASSERT `Art 54(1) the provider must appoint, by written mandate, an authorised representative which is established in the Union` `Art 53 test a later day` `Art 53 test model` TRUE `Established or located in a third country` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- "providers established in third countries"
#ASSERT `Art 54(1) the provider must appoint, by written mandate, an authorised representative which is established in the Union` `Art 53 test a later day` `Art 53 test model` TRUE `Established or located in the Union` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 54(1) the provider must appoint, by written mandate, an authorised representative which is established in the Union` `Art 53 test a later day` `Art 53 test model` TRUE `Established or located in a third country` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 54(1) the provider must appoint, by written mandate, an authorised representative which is established in the Union` `Art 53 test the day before the group applies` `Art 53 test model` TRUE `Established or located in a third country` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 54(1) the provider must appoint, by written mandate, an authorised representative which is established in the Union` `Art 53 test a later day` `Art 53 test model` FALSE `Established or located in a third country` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
