#ASSERT `Art 54(1) the provider must appoint, by written mandate, an authorised representative which is established in the Union` `Art 53 test the first day of the legacy time` `Art 53 test legacy model` TRUE `Established or located in a third country` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- args: date asked, model, general-purpose AI model, the provider's place, the exception applies, date appointed, date the model is placed on the Union market, by written mandate, the representative is established in the Union
-- the day before the placing is in time
#ASSERT `Art 54(1) the appointment of the authorised representative is what the paragraph requires` `Art 53 test a later day` `Art 53 test model` TRUE `Established or located in a third country` FALSE (Date 9 3 2026) (Date 10 3 2026) TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
