#ASSERT `Art 54(1) the appointment of the authorised representative is what the paragraph requires` `Art 53 test a later day` `Art 53 test model` TRUE `Established or located in a third country` FALSE (Date 11 3 2026) (Date 10 3 2026) TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
